This product includes software developed as part of the following projects:

* mem0 (https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0) — Apache License 2.0
  Used as the semantic fact store (vector store + history bookkeeping).

* mem0-mcp-server (https://github.com/zfy258/mem0-mcp-server) — Apache License 2.0
  OPTIONAL runtime dependency. When the `mem0-mcp-server` distribution is
  installed, its `mcp_server` module is used verbatim so that fact storage
  semantics (store layout, history.db bookkeeping, embedder configuration)
  match other tools in the same ecosystem exactly. The module is NOT vendored
  into this repository; it is an ordinary dependency.

* codebase-memory-mcp (https://github.com/DeusData/codebase-memory-mcp)
  OPTIONAL external runtime dependency, invoked as a separate process. Its
  licence is that of the upstream project; nothing from it is redistributed
  here.
